{"seq":5,"slug":"level-and-compensation","title":"Level And Compensation","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/corporate-management/bgi/level-and-compensation","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"career-level-system","title":"华大基因职级体系：三序列双通道架构","url":"/l-doc-books/h/corporate-management/bgi/level-and-compensation/career-level-system","wordCount":2014,"readingTime":9},{"seq":2,"slug":"compensation-structure","title":"华大基因薪酬福利结构","url":"/l-doc-books/h/corporate-management/bgi/level-and-compensation/compensation-structure","wordCount":2020,"readingTime":9},{"seq":3,"slug":"performance-evaluation","title":"华大基因绩效考核体系","url":"/l-doc-books/h/corporate-management/bgi/level-and-compensation/performance-evaluation","wordCount":2084,"readingTime":9},{"seq":4,"slug":"workplace-survival-guide","title":"华大基因职场生存指南","url":"/l-doc-books/h/corporate-management/bgi/level-and-compensation/workplace-survival-guide","wordCount":2290,"readingTime":10}],"introHtml":"<p>华大基因的职级与薪酬体系兼具科研院所和科技企业的双重特征。公司建立了管理和专业&quot;双通道&quot;职业发展体系，采用&quot;鹰线&quot;和&quot;翼线&quot;两线结合的人才进阶模式。本章从职级架构、薪酬福利结构、绩效考核机制和职场适应策略四个维度，系统解读华大基因的人力资源管理体系，帮助求职者和在职员工建立清晰的职业发展预期。需要注意的是，华大的薪酬竞争力在行业中偏中等水平，但其科研平台价值和参与前沿项目的机会构成了独特的非货币激励。</p>\n"}